## Logging

### Structured Logging
```csharp
_logger.LogInformation("Client subscribed",
    new { ConnectionId, AuctionId, Timestamp = DateTimeOffset.UtcNow });

_logger.LogError(ex, "Failed to broadcast event",
    new { Subject = msg.Subject, AuctionId, ErrorMessage = ex.Message });
```

### Log Levels
- **Debug**: Подробности NATS сообщений
- **Information**: Подписки, отписки, broadcast событий
- **Warning**: Неожиданные subjects
- **Error**: Ошибки десериализации Protobuf
- **Critical**: NATS connection lost

## Testing

### Unit Tests для EventBroadcaster
```csharp
public class EventBroadcasterTests
{
    private readonly Mock<IHubContext<AuctionHub>> _hubContextMock;
    private readonly Mock<IHubClients> _clientsMock;
    private readonly Mock<IClientProxy> _groupProxyMock;

    public EventBroadcasterTests()
    {
        _hubContextMock = new Mock<IHubContext<AuctionHub>>();
        _clientsMock = new Mock<IHubClients>();
        _groupProxyMock = new Mock<IClientProxy>();

        _clientsMock.Setup(c => c.Group(It.IsAny<string>()))
            .Returns(_groupProxyMock.Object);

        _hubContextMock.Setup(h => h.Clients)
            .Returns(_clientsMock.Object);
    }

    [Fact]
    public async Task BroadcastAsync_SendsToCorrectGroup()
    {
        var auctionId = "123";
        var eventData = new { type = "test" };

        await _broadcaster.BroadcastAsync(auctionId, eventData, CancellationToken.None);

        _clientsMock.Verify(
            c => c.Group($"auction:{auctionId}"),
            Times.Once);

        _groupProxyMock.Verify(
            p => p.SendCoreAsync("AuctionEvent", It.IsAny<object[]>(), It.IsAny<CancellationToken>()),
            Times.Once);
    }
}
```

